Error [E0302]: `@unknown` is not a compiler-owned fact
  --> tests/ui/compiler_fact_unknown_member.jet:3:17
    |
  3 |     print(value.@unknown)
    |                 ^^^^^^^^
 Why: the compiler-owned facts are `@layout`, `@name`, `@fields`, `@range`, `@dimension`, `@measure`, `@exactness`, `@classification`, `@obligation`, `@states`, `@effects`, `@sendability`, `@movedness`, `@attribution`, `@origin`, `@view_provenance`, `@unit_scale_provenance`, `@maturity`, `@profile`, `@flow`, `@taint`, `@duty`
 Fix: write a registered fact read such as `T.@layout`
